1 REM FBCS NUM-0258
2 REM CLAIM A-5.6.4-TR144
3 REM TYPE OUTPUT
4 REM STD 5.6.4 l.2287-2289 and 8.2.6: GOTO to an OPTION line inside an internal SUB continues at the next line.
10 SUB S
20 LET K = 0
30 OPTION ANGLE DEGREES
